Package: linkrs
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Graph Database Binding
Description: Thin R binding over the Linkrs C API (bring your own
    liblinkrs). Covers databases, sessions, transactions, results, schema,
    queries and statistics with the same semantics as the Python,
    JavaScript, Go and Java bindings.
Authors@R: person("linkrs contributors", email = "linkrs-maintainers@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
License: Apache-2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite
SystemRequirements: C toolchain; liblinkrs built with the c_api feature
